{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"jarl/proofs/consensus/Proofs.lean","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-07T08:27:44.591702Z","id":"b45abb5da5fa31884b2b9569fa27151ccb5b8bc28921f5dfdf8cfda6d92d81b3","body":{"detail":"Both theorems conclude only `index <= new and index <= old` (or `<= leader and <= matched`). The private `joint_value` (lines 95-99) proves the exact `min new old` but is not an obligation. Rewriting `new.min(old)` in src/membership.rs:163, or `commit.min(matched)` in src/node.rs:946/962, to return 0 would pass every consensus obligation, and followers would then never advance their commit index. README.md:45 calls these contracts 'joint/follower minima'. The mutation list in jarl/tests/proof_cases/lean.rs:14-28 only swaps min for max.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":101},"end":{"line":114},"content_hash":"0236bcdb097fb0d1f2c44727f28a383f6eae5e67ac2c0260029bd43bc82d1ad2"},"suggested_fix":"Make the exported theorems state equality to `min` (promote `joint_value`), and add a constant-0 mutation to lean.rs.","summary":"joint_commit_requires_both and follower_never_overcommits prove only upper bounds, so a commit index of 0 still satisfies them","tags":["review","review:2026-10-07-deep","session:claude-code:a11d54e5-e61a-4ddb-ada4-de40e3db1dad"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"jarl/proofs/consensus/Proofs.lean","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-07T10:08:39.037841Z","id":"1b01d45f07e664d2ccf7c53eb6d87988ac1869b7cfc891f7bd6cf785f03da46c","body":{"detail":"consensus/Proofs.lean:95-99: private theorem joint_value proves = min new old. joint_commit_requires_both (:101-107) and follower_never_overcommits (:109-114) conclude only index <= both inputs, which a constant 0 satisfies. Sources: src/membership.rs:163 new.min(old), and src/node.rs:948 and :966 commit.min(matched) (the finding cites 946/962). lean.rs:16-17 mutates these only to max. README.md:45 calls them 'joint/follower minima'.","kind":"comment","references":"b45abb5da5fa31884b2b9569fa27151ccb5b8bc28921f5dfdf8cfda6d92d81b3","summary":"confirmed: joint/follower minima are exported only as upper bounds; the exact-min joint_value is private","tags":["verified:confirmed","session:claude-code:a11d54e5-e61a-4ddb-ada4-de40e3db1dad"]}}
